{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>iFixit 今日拆解了 Apple 配備觸控螢幕的 PROLED MacBook Pro，以探討其重量減輕方式、Logo 運作原理，並與 14 吋 M6 MacBook Pro 進行比較。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Inside Apples Most Interesting MacBook Display 9 1 screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Inside-Apples-Most-Interesting-MacBook-Display-9-1-screenshot-1024x576.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2>發光 Logo 結構與維修挑戰</h2>\n<p>Apple 在 PROLED MacBook Pro 背面加入了可發光的 Logo，由於沒有背光層照明，Apple 使用了四個 LED、反射層和擴散片來產生均勻的光暈。當燈光關閉時，Logo 上的雙向鏡面塗層使其呈現亮面外觀。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Inside Apples Most Interesting MacBook Display 7 44 screenshot 1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Inside-Apples-Most-Interesting-MacBook-Display-7-44-screenshot-1-1024x576.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>然而，為了維修而接觸到 Logo 並不容易，因為它位於顯示器後面。如果該部分損壞，唯一的維修選項就是移除整個螢幕。iFixit 在拆解過程中最終損壞了面板，因為玻璃與下層的結構分離，導致 OLED 面板報廢。</p>\n<h2>鉸鏈設計與元件更換性</h2>\n<p>Apple 表示 PROLED MacBook Pro 的鉸鏈是為觸控操作而設計的，但 iFixit 指出其與 M6 MacBook Pro 的鉸鏈基本上相同，只是剛性更高，因此在頂部點擊螢幕時能更好地保持角度。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Inside Apples Most Interesting MacBook Display 6 35 screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Inside-Apples-Most-Interesting-MacBook-Display-6-35-screenshot-1024x576.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>Thunderbolt/USB-C 端口和風扇可以更換，但必須先取出主板。HDMI 端口和 SDXC 卡槽焊接在主板上，因此較難替換。SSD 和記憶體也同樣採用焊接方式。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Inside Apples Most Interesting MacBook Display 6 18 screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Inside-Apples-Most-Interesting-MacBook-Display-6-18-screenshot-1024x576.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2>零件配對與重量差異</h2>\n<p>iFixit 將兩台 PROLED MacBook Pro 的主板互換，在執行「維修助手」（Repair Assistant）後，所有組件均正常運作，包括觸控螢幕和 Touch ID。iFixit 表示，觸控螢幕並未引入任何新的零件配對問題。</p>\n<p>PROLED MacBook Pro 的觸控板比 M6 型號略小，重量則透過減少底殼的一些鋁材來降低。其底殼重 364 克，而 M6 型號為 456 克。儘管增加了觸控螢幕和發光 Logo，顯示器總成卻輕了 101 克，電池也輕了 2 克。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Inside Apples Most Interesting MacBook Display 6 43 screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Inside-Apples-Most-Interesting-MacBook-Display-6-43-screenshot-1024x576.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<h2>維修評分結果</h2>\n<p>PROLED MacBook Pro 獲得了 5/10 的維修評分，這比 M5 MacBook Pro 高出一分，但比 MacBook Neo 低一分。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Inside Apples Most Interesting MacBook Display 9 38 screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"576\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Inside-Apples-Most-Interesting-MacBook-Display-9-38-screenshot-1024x576.webp\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T00:08:58.253739+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":871,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T22:24:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T00:40:18.570947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:02:36.330701+00:00","content_hash":"b72f28227b86813187b67f5d6554d9adb9fe55bbceb0bdd5fe891e467c41d9cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}